==History==
2017
*The Skeleton Barrel was playable in the [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Mirror Challenge]] on 17/10/2017, before its release date, as an unintended glitch. Supercell fixed this glitch with a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (17/10/2017)|maintenance break]].
*On 31/10/2017, the Skeleton Barrel became obtainable by achieving 9 wins in the Halloween Draft Challenge.
*From 11/11/2017 through 14/11/2017, the [[Shop]] had a special offer where [[Arenas|Arena 6]]+ players could buy up to 6 Giant [[Chests]] at the normal price that guarantee at least 40% of the Chest's contents to be Skeleton Barrel.
*The Skeleton Barrel [[Cards|card]] was generally released on 17/11/2017.
*On 23/11/2017, a [[Version History#Maintenance%20Break%20(23/11/2017)|maintenance break]], temporarily removed the Skeleton Barrel from the [[Touchdown]] [[:Category:Modes|mode]] due to a bug where scoring a touchdown did not clear flying barrels from the Arena, which break into [[Skeletons]] to score another touchdown while the opponent is unable to defend against it.
*On 12/12/2017, the [[Version History#Electrifying Update (12/12/2017)|Electrifying Update]], allowed the Skeleton Barrel to deal Death Damage.
2018
*On 12/1/2018, the Skeleton Barrel was added back to the Touchdown mode, the glitch presumably fixed.
*On 12/2/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (12/2/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the Skeleton Barrel's Skeletons spawned upon death to 6 (from 8).
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Update%20(25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]], increased the Skeleton Barrel's Skeletons spawned upon death to 7 (from 6).
*On 5/11/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/11/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Skeleton Barrel's death damage by 62%.
2019
*On 15/4/2019, the [[Version History#April%202019%20Update%20(15/4/2019)|April 2019 Update]], added an extra [[Star Points|Star Level]].
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Skeleton Barrel's card info screen.
2020
*On 7/4/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/4/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased its the Skeleton Barrel's hitpoints by 15%, but also increased its speed to 90 (from 60), now classified as Fast.
*On 10/9/2020, an [[Version History#Optional%20Update%20(10/9/2020)|Optional Update]], made it so that a [[Clone|cloned]] Skeleton Barrel would now function correctly.
*On 9/12/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/12/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Skeleton Barrel's hitpoints by 19%.
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Skeleton Barrel from Builder's Workshop to Spooky Town.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Skeleton Barrel from Spooky Town to Jungle Arena.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2024
*On 8/10/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/10/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Skeleton Barrel’s death damage by 9%.
2025
* On 7/7/2025, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (7/7/2025)|July 2025 Update]], added the Skeleton Barrel's Evolution.
* On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] made it so that the [[Witch/Evolution|Evolved Witch]] would no longer be healed by defeated Skeletons.
* On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)=|Balance Update]] increased the Skeleton's attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 1.0 seconds).

