==Trivia==
*The word "''Skeleton''" comes from the Greek "''σκελετός''" (''skeletós''), meaning dried up or withered.
**The Skeleton Barrel is 1 of 15 [[cards]] associated with [[Skeletons]], with the others being [[Bomber]], [[Skeleton Dragons]], [[Tombstone]], [[Bomb Tower]], [[Guards]], [[Skeleton Army]], [[Witch]], [[Balloon]], [[Giant Skeleton]], [[Wall Breakers]], [[Super Witch]], [[Graveyard]], [[Skeleton King]], and of course, Skeletons.
*The Skeleton Barrel could be inspired by Clash of Clans' Builder Base Troop, [[w:c:clashofclans:Drop Ship|Drop Ship]], which also does damage and summons Skeletons when destroyed.
*The Skeleton Barrel is 1 of 17 [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] that inspired a troop in Clash of Clans, the others being [[Spear Goblins]], Bomber, [[Bats]], [[Minion Horde]], [[Firecracker]], [[Battle Ram]], [[Ice Golem]], [[Zappies]], [[Baby Dragon]], Giant Skeleton, [[Ram Rider]], [[Inferno Dragon]], [[Miner]], [[Royal Ghost]], [[Ice Wizard]], and [[Night Witch]].
**In Clash of Clans, the Skeleton Barrel in battle looks identical to an enemy Skeleton Barrel in Clash Royale. Unlike its [https://clashofclans.fandom.com/wiki/Skeleton_Barrel Clash of Clans counterpart], the Skeleton Barrel in Clash Royale attacks only buildings.
**The Skeleton Barrel's visual appearance resembles Clash of Clans' [[w:c:clashofclans:Air Bombs|Air Bombs]] and its projectiles. The barrel itself is stylized very similarly to Level 6 and 7 Balloons from Clash of Clans.
*The Skeleton Barrel is 1 of 8 troops to die as a part of their attack, the others being the [[Electro Spirit]], [[Fire Spirit]], [[Ice Spirit]], [[Battle Ram]], [[Heal Spirit]], [[Suspicious Bush]], and Wall Breakers.
*The Skeleton Barrel is one of the first troop cards to receive a card render, alongside the [[Archers]], [[Knight]], [[Goblins]], Bomber, Skeletons, [[Barbarians]], Bats, [[Royal Recruits]], [[Rascals]], [[Musketeer]], [[Giant]], [[Valkyrie]], [[Wizard]], [[Flying Machine]], [[Hog Rider]], [[Royal Hogs]], [[Dart Goblin]], Zappies, [[Elixir Golem]], Baby Dragon, Skeleton Army, Witch, [[P.E.K.K.A.|P.E.K.K.A]], [[Prince]], Balloon, Giant Skeleton, [[Goblin Giant]], [[Hunter]], [[Electro Dragon]], Wall Breakers, [[Bowler]], [[Cannon Cart]], [[Mega Knight]], Ram Rider, Miner, Royal Ghost, Ice Wizard, [[Magic Archer]], [[Bandit]], [[Lava Hound]], Night Witch, and [[Fisherman]].
*In the Italian, Korean, Russian, Chinese, Thai, and Vietnamese language settings of the game, the Skeleton Barrel's name translates to "Bone Barrel", "Skull Barrel", "Barrel with Skeletons", "Skull Balloon", "Skeleton Tank", and "Skeleton Box" respectively.
*The Skeleton Barrel is 1 of 7 troops that has had its movement speed classification changed, the others being [[Elite Barbarians]], Suspicious Bush, [[Goblin Cage|Goblin Brawler]], Cannon Cart, [[Lumberjack]], and the [[Mighty Miner]].
*The barrel of the Skeleton Barrel looks similar to the hull of the [[Rocket]].
*The Skeleton Barrel has the same deploying sound as the Balloon, but with a higher pitch.
*The Skeleton Barrel has been featured in multiple [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|special game modes]] outside of the card. More specifically:
**The Skeleton Barrel is the only troop that has been featured with a [[Buff#Death Damage|Death Damage]] [[buff]].
**The Skeleton Barrel is 1 of 10 troops that has been featured under the [[Ruler Ability#Special Delivery|Special Delivery]] [[Ruler Ability|ruler ability]], the others being Knight, [[Mini P.E.K.K.A.|Mini P.E.K.K.A]], Musketeer, Wizard, P.E.K.K.A, Giant Skeleton, [[Golem]], [[Sparky]], and Royal Ghost.
*Although not available as a troop, the Skeleton Barrel reappears as [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/Witch Witch]'s active ability in [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/Squad_Busters_Wiki Squad Busters].
*In the [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Mirror Challenge]] and in its [https://youtu.be/U3io23q-Gk8?si=XG1uDOI5S-T_f_z1 reveal trailer], the Skeleton Barrel was shown to spawn all Skeletons in a random pattern. However, this was changed after its general release to spawn the Skeletons in a circular formation.
*The Skeleton Barrel loses 1 balloon for each third of its total hitpoints depleted. A [[Clone]]d Skeleton Barrel does not follow this rule, however, and always has 3 balloons. These balloons do not regenerate if the Skeleton Barrel is healed up to at least one-third (or two-thirds) health.

